              "step1": "Tên đang xử lý: Helena Vos . Bài nhắc đến Helena Vos ở đoạn C.",
              "step2": "Behind the redesign was the Floating Homestead Initiative , a not-for-profit that since 2004 has studied and refitted buildings to let them ride out flooding . Hardly anyone was speaking about a shifting climate when the work began , recalls its founder, Dr Helena Vos , yet what her team does is now called for in places that had no use for it before . Câu (3): xác định công việc của Floating Homestead Initiative là giúp công trình trụ được qua lũ . Câu (4): Helena Vos cho biết những nơi trước đây không cần nay cũng cần công việc này => thêm địa điểm cần chống lũ . 🔎 Khớp với statement 13: The tally of places needing defence against floods has climbed of late . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: defence against floods ride out flooding The tally of places + has climbed of late is now called for in places + that had no use for it before",
