              "step2": "Yet Marta Óskarsdóttir , of the Sustainable Construction Council, warns that saving carbon this way is not as simple as it sounds . ' You can certainly cut a building's overall carbon impact by substituting waste products for cement ,' she says . Haul them a long way on fossil fuels and the switch may make no sense at all in terms of cutting carbon overall .' Câu (5)–(6): Marta Óskarsdóttir cảnh báo về cách giảm carbon bằng phế phẩm thay xi măng, dù cách này có thể mang lại lợi ích. Câu (8): vận chuyển phế phẩm xa bằng nhiên liệu hóa thạch có thể triệt tiêu lợi ích giảm carbon đó. 🔎 Khớp với statement 11: The carbon savings from cement substitutes can be cancelled out by the distances the materials must travel . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: carbon savings cut a building's overall carbon impact cement substitutes substituting waste products for cement can be cancelled out may make no sense + in terms of cutting carbon overall distances the materials must travel a long way",
