              "step3": "Đoạn G: The canopy basket fern , which perches on trees purely for support rather than drawing any nourishment from them, grows wild across many tropical regions, where it does the job of a keystone species . Reintroduce it to the plantations , Molnár believes, and these barren tracts could slowly win back their wildlife , offering shelter to everything from fungi and bacteria to insects, frogs, lizards and even small mammals . Câu (3): giới thiệu canopy basket fern, giúp xác định “it” ở câu sau. Câu (4): đưa cây ấy trở lại đồn điền => vùng đất có thể lấy lại sinh vật hoang dã .",
