              "step3": "Đoạn 3: Each listener had to say whether the two people laughing were friends or had never met before . What emerged was strikingly uniform from one society to the next: wherever they lived , listeners judged correctly a little under sixty per cent of the time . Câu (3): người nghe chọn giữa hai khả năng => mức đoán mò là 50%. Câu (4): người nghe phán đoán đúng gần 60% , cao hơn mức đó .",
