              "step4": "On the Kesslerian account , which recalls the older doctrine of rule by a class of guardian-sages , human beings enter the world with unequal endowments of intelligence , so that those given less of it need the guiding hand of those given more — whether such guardians are called government officials or something grander . Leave those people to themselves , the reasoning goes, and what follows will be what has supposedly always followed: a slide into disorder . Câu (1): Câu (1), đoạn G: trí thông minh khác nhau ngay từ lúc sinh ra => người ít trí thông minh cần người thông minh hơn dẫn dắt, với vai trò như quan chức . Câu (3): Câu (3), đoạn G: nếu người ít trí thông minh không được dẫn dắt => họ sẽ đi tới hỗn loạn . 🔎 Khớp với statement 10: Differences in intelligence are present from the moment of birth . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: Differences in intelligence unequal + intelligence from the moment of birth enter the world Those with greater intelligence those given more positions of authority government officials Those with greater intelligence those given more positions of authority government officials Without guidance Leave those people to themselves less intelligent people those given less of it tend towards disorder a slide into disorder Without guidance Leave those people to themselves less intelligent people those given less of it tend towards disorder a slide into disorder 🔎 Khớp với statement 11: Those with greater intelligence ought to occupy positions of authority . Vai trò dẫn dắt được gắn với quan chức (“government officials”), nên đây là quyền hành , không chỉ là giúp đỡ người khác. 🔎 Khớp với statement 13: Without guidance , less intelligent people tend towards disorder ."
