              "step4": "Play is also, very often, ranged along a spectrum from the intensely playful to the barely playful , measured against a set of behavioural and dispositional markers (Calderwood et al. 1998 ) . Câu (4): Câu (4), đoạn 5: thang từ rất đến hầu như không mang tính chơi => đánh giá hoạt động theo mức độ mang tính chơi . 🔎 Khớp với statement 5: Play can be rated according to how playful it is . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: can be rated ranged along a spectrum according to how playful it is from the intensely playful to the barely playful"
