            "prompt": "In the simplest form of guided play, an adult adds to the environment in which the child is playing. In a more involved form, an adult may step into the game as an equal [(37) _____] and build on it, for instance by asking questions or by pointing out what the child has discovered. Such playful learning may be given a degree of structure, but the _____ to play still has to originate with the child.",
