            "prompt": "Weaknesses of the studies examined • most looked at single animals instead of whole [(36) _____] • the [(37) _____] of plastic in laboratory work often differed from those found at sea • too little was known about – the number of animals that might be affected – the effect that a drop in one species' numbers would have on its _____ – the effect on the ecosystem",
