              "step2": "Yet consider how the athletic-shoe maker Velos wove the digital revolution into its standing for high-performance footwear . Joining forces in 2007 with the technology firm Kestrel , it launched Velos Motion, a digital sports kit made up of a sensor that clips to a running shoe and a wireless receiver that links to the wearer's portable music player . Fusing what Velos had always offered recreational athletes with something for digital consumers, the Motion kit and its website carried the company beyond sportswear onto a new level of contact with its customers . Câu (4): Velos lồng cách mạng số vào lĩnh vực giày => tiếp nhận xu hướng từ ngành khác . Câu (5)–(6): hợp tác với công ty công nghệ để tạo sản phẩm số => mở rộng ra ngoài đồ thể thao . 🔎 Khớp với statement 9: It widened what it offered by teaming up with a separate producer . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: widened what it offered beyond sportswear by teaming up Joining forces a separate producer the technology firm Kestrel took up wove a fast growing trend the digital revolution a completely separate line of business footwear the technology firm took up wove a fast growing trend the digital revolution a completely separate line of business footwear the technology firm 🔎 Khớp với statement 11: It took up a fast-growing trend that had emerged in a completely separate line of business .",
