            "prompt": "Philosophy was only one of the fields in which Anselm Roth was busy. During the 1780s he proposed a form of technology intended to make [(30) _____] between the different departments of the state easier. To make banknotes more difficult to copy, he devised a new printing technique that would improve their [(31) _____] , and he also worked out a method for the [(32) _____] of food. His prison design was meant to permit the constant [(33) _____] of those held inside, and he thought the same plan would suit other kinds of institution too. In his work on happiness, he looked into ways of achieving its _____ , proposing several techniques for the purpose.",
            "type": "FILL_IN_BLANK",
