              "step2": "Dario Fenwick , who heads the Global Fund for Rural Development, argued that a government can lower farmers' exposure simply by supplying the basics — roads that carry crops to market faster, or stores for water and food that stop so much being lost . Cung cấp cơ sở vật chất như đường sá giúp giảm rủi ro cho nông dân . 🔎 Khớp với statement 9: Better basic facilities such as roads can substantially lower the risks farmers run . Đối chiếu paraphrasing: Better basic facilities such as roads by supplying the basics — roads lower the risks farmers run lower farmers' exposure",
