            "prompt": "Later on, children start to notice how other people regard them. A significant stage here is the moment, usually reached at around the age of two, when a child can recognise itself by sight. In Western cultures at any rate, a child's developing self-awareness is frequently bound up with a feeling of _____ , something that can give rise to disputes.",
